  "applies_to": "LG PAHCMS000 AHU Communication Kit for discharge (supply) air control with up to four LG outdoor units, installation manual IM_AHU_Comm_Kit_PAHCMS000_11_23.",
  "summary": "The PAHCMS000 kit connects a third-party air handler to LG Multi V or single-split outdoor units and controls discharge air temperature; a DDC can drive it over Modbus RTU on RS485 CH4. A coil switches the unit, holding registers set mode, capacity request and the cooling and heating discharge targets, and discrete inputs and input registers report unit and per-outdoor-unit (up to 4) run, compressor, defrost and error status, the error code and return/supply air temperatures.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU"
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "unit_id": null,
    "baud": null,
    "parity": null,
    "data_bits": null,
    "stop_bits": null,
    "tcp_port": null
  },
  "addressing": {
    "convention": "Modicon",
    "note": "Points are printed as 00001/10001/30001/40001-style registers, with a function-code table per block (01/05 coils 00001-00008, 02 inputs 10001-10030, 04 input registers 30001-30016, 03/06 holding registers 40001-40010). The wire address is the printed number minus the block base: 30011 is input register 10."
  },
  "default_word_order": null,
  "firmware": null,
  "source": {
    "title": "Installation Manual for LG Air Handler Unit (AHU) Communications Kit - PAHCMS000",
    "doc_number": "IM_AHU_Comm_Kit_PAHCMS000_11_23",
    "revision_date": "2023-11",
    "url": "https://media.us.lg.com/m/11adf83da67f6527/original/IM_AHU_Comm_Kit_PAHCMS000-pdf.pdf",
    "pages": "pp. 55-56 function codes and memory map; DIP switch SW1 table in the installation section"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Access follows the function-code dots in the memory map: coil 00001 takes 01 and 05, discrete inputs 02 only, input registers 04 only, holding registers 03 and 06.",
    "Reserved points are left out.",
    "The manual does not print the RS485 serial settings for the DDC port; set them to match the kit (the R32 sister kit PAHCMR000 states 9600 bps, no parity, 1 stop bit, but that is a different manual).",
    "Temperatures are sent multiplied by 10; the return/supply air range includes negative values, so they are listed as signed 16-bit.",
    "For the capacity ratio behind register 40002 see the UI7 (0-10 V) capacity table in the manual.",
    "An older revision of this manual (IM_AHU_Comm_Kit_PAHCMS000_5_18) is also hosted by LG."
  ],
